    "title": "IWM overnight gap reverses in the first half hour",
    "one_line": "If IWM opens beyond a gap threshold from the prior close, trade against the gap at 09:31 and hold about 30 minutes. Source: Iwanaga and Sakemoto (2025), Intraday time series reversal.",
